prefix_rule(pattern=["nix", "develop", "--accept-flake-config", ".#ci", "-c", "br", "update", "yazelix-0j5wh", "--notes", "Additive stale-state protection added: generated-state cache now records schema_version=2, materializer_schema_version=2, runtime_source metadata, and includes the materializer schema in the runtime refresh hash so stale generated files refresh once after the clipboard generator change. Current code rejects known runtime downgrades when recorded runtime_source.last_modified_date is newer than the runtime being used. Fixed Zellij metadata path to .yazelix_generation.json so planner reads the file written by materialization. Proof: cargo test --manifest-path rust_core/yazelix_core/Cargo.toml config_state -- --test-threads=1 (6 passed); runtime_materialization (10 passed); clipboard (5 passed); temp repair detected runtime inputs changed, regenerated, and second run was noop; temp generated Zellij copy_command and Mars Copy/Paste bindings present."], decision="allow")
